WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:09.250
In your account, open Billing from the menu.

2
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:13.650
Choose Unpaid, to see only the invoices that are due.

3
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:24.250
Click Pay next to the invoice you want to pay.

4
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.972
The invoice opens in our secure client area.

5
00:00:26.972 --> 00:00:33.000
Choose a payment method, and confirm.
